Minnosh brings the most used OPNsense settings onto a single, simple screen:
see every device on the network, cut a device's internet access with one
click, block ads, malware, adult content, gambling and apps via DNS, and
watch internet traffic and blocked requests on an overview page.

Minnosh does not keep a parallel configuration: it writes to OPNsense's own
firewall alias ("minnosh_blocked"), automatic firewall rules and the Unbound
blocklist policy "Minnosh (managed)", so everything stays visible in the
regular OPNsense pages.
